    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\ud83d\udc7b The Cute little virtual pet ghost that helps you learn to type! </h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udda5\ufe0f <strong>He</strong> <strong>lives on your desktop</strong> </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>\ud83c\udfae Play minigames with Ghostie to keep him happy</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2328\ufe0f <strong>Get better at typing, <i>that makes him happiest!</i></strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf6c <strong>And... feed him... <i>OR HE'LL DIE!</i></strong></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617890/extras/9a03c47c6e8c9282e87f755b283457df.poster.avif?t=1752570875\" width=650 height=464 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617890/extras/9a03c47c6e8c9282e87f755b283457df.webm?t=1752570875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617890/extras/9a03c47c6e8c9282e87f755b283457df.mp4?t=1752570875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>From 2 to 18 letter words! </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Some words you'll know and bunch more you'll learn as you play.</strong></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Why play?</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2328\ufe0f Helps <strong>improve</strong> your typing</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc1 <strong>Compete</strong> against the steam community </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udfc6 <strong>Challenge yourself</strong> to be the <strong>best typer</strong> you can be</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617890/extras/afc7f68baf2e52d2b699049915d0cbc0.poster.avif?t=1752570875\" width=606 height=222 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617890/extras/afc7f68baf2e52d2b699049915d0cbc0.webm?t=1752570875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617890/extras/afc7f68baf2e52d2b699049915d0cbc0.mp4?t=1752570875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cool Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83e\udd87 <strong>Collect bats</strong> to help push back the Boos</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83d\udc7b Pop special Boos for <strong>ghoulish PowerUps</strong></p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\ud83c\udf6c Keep <strong>your Ghostie</strong> fed and &quot;alive&quot; with <strong>delicious candy</strong> corn</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617890/extras/a7ac49d37e47adf4400242d57ca430fc.poster.avif?t=1752570875\" width=606 height=134 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617890/extras/a7ac49d37e47adf4400242d57ca430fc.webm?t=1752570875\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3617890/extras/a7ac49d37e47adf4400242d57ca430fc.mp4?t=1752570875\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
